# Release archives built for distribution. Never commit one: a zip of this
# repository, inside this repository, permanently bloats the history (archives do
# not delta-compress), duplicates content git already tracks, and is stale the
# moment anything changes. Build one on demand instead:
#   git archive --format=zip --prefix=lunowix/ -o lunowix.zip main
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
